line	<str>Talk to Reldo in the library of Varrock Palace. ( if Shield of Arrav not started.) Skip this step if you already met Thurgo during The Giant Dwarf.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Thurgo</col> south of <col=800000>Port Sarim</col> (by the anvil, north of the <col=800000>fairy ring</col> AIQ) and give him a <col=800000>redberry pie</col>. ( if <col=800000>The Giant Dwarf</col> quest is in progress.)</col>
