line	<col=000080>Climb-up the ladder on the eastern side of the castle to the uk=1. Go west and climb-up the eastern staircase. Search the <col=800000>cupboard</col> in <col=800000>Sir Vyvin</col>'s bedroom for a <col=800000>portrait</col>. He must not be looking at you.</col>
