step	9	-	Quick guide step 9
line	<str>Talk to the Squire in the White Knights' Castle.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Reldo in the library of Varrock Palace. ( if Shield of Arrav not started.) Skip this step if you already met Thurgo during The Giant Dwarf.</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to Thurgo south of Port Sarim (by the anvil, north of the fairy ring AIQ) and give him a redberry pie. ( if The Giant Dwarf quest is in progress.)</str>
line	
line	<str>Talk to him again.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go back and talk to the Squire.</str>
line	
line	<str>Climb-up the ladder on the eastern side of the castle to the uk=1. Go west and climb-up the eastern staircase. Search the cupboard in Sir Vyvin's bedroom for a portrait. He must not be looking at you.</str>
line	
line	<str>Proceed back to Thurgo and give him the portrait. Bring iron bars with you.</str>
line	
line	<str>Go to the Asgarnian Ice Dungeon using the trapdoor to the east of Thurgo.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Once inside, follow the path west, north, and then east. Keep along the southern wall in the icy area and mine a <col=800000>blurite ore</col>. Mine another if planning on doing the <col=800000>Falador Easy Diary</col>.</col>
